faiss-cpu — MIT; onnxruntime (and onnxruntime-directml) — MIT.

The programs of the intake (Tesseract OCR, LibreOffice, 7-Zip, DjVuLibre) are not part of Assistant X: an offline
medium carries them as separate programs, with programs/VERSIONS.txt naming the license and the source code of each,
and the source archives of DjVuLibre and 7-Zip in programs/sources/ (assistant_x/setup/medium.py).
